@stockUrl = http://localhost:8081
@orderUrl = http://localhost:8082
@accountUrl = http://localhost:8083

### 查询库存
GET {{stockUrl}}/stocks/1

### 查询账户可用余额与冻结余额
GET {{accountUrl}}/accounts/1

### 创建订单：预期 201，库存 AT 扣减，账户 TCC 确认扣款
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "exception": true
}

### 查询订单：将 1 换成创建订单返回的 id，包含成交单价与总金额
GET {{orderUrl}}/orders/1

### Try 成功后模拟异常：预期 500，订单/库存回滚，账户取消冻结
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 100,
  "exception": false
}

### 余额不足：用户 2 初始余额 1 元，预期 409，订单/库存回滚
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 库存不足：预期 409，订单回滚，不调用账户冻结
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2147483647
}
